OL,3,GNEWSAViolent video watched by Southport
OL,4,Akiller still on X
OL,5,
OL,6,FA violent video watched by Axel
OL,7,FRudakubana before he murdered three
OL,8,Fgirls in Southport is still available
OL,9,Fto view on X, an inquiry has heard.
OL,11,FThe Southport Inquiry was told
OL,12,FRudakubana viewed footage showing a
OL,13,Fbishop being stabbed during a sermon in
OL,14,FSydney, Australia, just minutes before
OL,15,Fleaving home to carry out the attack.
OL,17,FGiving evidence to the inquiry, Sheen
OL,18,FHandoo, X's compliance and safety lead,
OL,19,Fconfirmed the clip was "still live" for
OL,20,Fadult UK users behind a sensitivity
OL,21,Fwarning.
